---
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro'
---

<Site title="About SEQ Campers" description="SEQ Campers is Queensland's home for premium off-road caravans. Three decades on the Sunshine Coast.">
  <div class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="page-eyebrow">About</div>
      <h1>Built for the long way home.</h1>
      <p>Thirty years of off-road caravans on the Sunshine Coast.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:760px;">
      <p style="font-size:1.1rem; line-height:1.8; color:#2A1608; margin-bottom:24px;">
        SEQ Campers is a Queensland-based dealership specialising in premium
        off-road caravans. Owned and run by Shane and Maud out of the Sunshine
        Coast, we have spent three decades getting Aussie families ready for
        the trips most people only dream about.
      </p>

      <p style="font-size:1.05rem; line-height:1.75; color:#2A1608; margin-bottom:24px;">
        We stock <strong>Kimberley Kampers</strong> and <strong>Stockman Caravans</strong>
        - two of the most respected off-road brands in the country. Every van
        on the lot is hand-picked, inspected, and prepared by people who have
        spent years on the corrugations themselves.
      </p>

      <p style="font-size:1.05rem; line-height:1.75; color:#2A1608; margin-bottom:32px;">
        Beyond sales, we offer on-site mechanic services, roadworthy
        inspections, and a YouTube channel with over 2,000 subscribers
        where Shane walks through caravans the way he would for his own family.
      </p>

      <div style="background:#fff; border:1px solid #DCCBA8; border-radius:8px; padding:24px 28px;">
        <div style="font-family:'Inter Tight', sans-serif; font-weight:600; color:#2A1608; margin-bottom:8px;">Visit us</div>
        <div style="color:#8B6A40; font-size:0.95rem; line-height:1.7;">
          Sunshine Coast, Queensland<br />
          (07) 5300 2344
        </div>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary" style="margin-top:20px;">Get in touch</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Site>
